in May this year the ninth part of the  very successful Fast &amp; Furious franchise  will be released the hype around the  action-packed movies which are more or  less about cars doesn't seem to stop at  least financially in an interview  leading actor Vin Diesel now revealed a  few details about the future of the  film's according to his own statement  the production of Fast and Furious 10  has already started in view of the  immense success of the series he even  went so far as to say that future  spin-offs are practically inevitable  diesel already gave a small foretaste at  the end of last month when he announced  a fast and furious with an all-female  cast in the interview he also mentioned  that Fast and Furious 10 might at least  be the end of the main movies and that  the final film will be released in two  parts if this is really true we will  probably find out after the release of  the ninth part on May 22nd 2020 last  week we already reported about a  possible Bambi remake this week the next  Disney classic is already in the line  for a remake according to the dis  Insider website lilo and Stitch will be  a live action and CGI mixed film and  will be set in Hawaii the 8th in Europe  movie lilo and Stitch is about a lonely  girl named lilo and the alien Stitch who  tries to hide more or less successfully  in the role of a dog both become friends  throughout the story and experience one  or the other adventure with each other  when the film was released in 2002 it  earned 273 million u.s. dollars on a 80  million dollar budget in the course of  time some sequels and spin-offs as well  as an own animated TV series were  created unfortunately there are  currently no concept pictures of how the  two could look like as live-action  characters anyway Disney doesn't seem to  want to stop making live-action remakes  from old classics in the foreseeable  future the fan community is rather split  in its opinion when the Disney Plus  production will be released is not yet  known after it was recently announced  that the shooting of the new Matrix  movie will start soon the first pictures  from the set have already been published  and the star of shooting has been  announced more or less officially but  will star actor Keanu Reeves be back in  his legendary outfit with a leather coat  and black sunglasses on the set he was  seen in his usual look of peered and  longer hair quite different it's the  case with Reef's colleague carrie-anne  moss who again embodies the role of  trinity because she looks quite similar  to back in the days besides the two  actors Reeves and lost there will also  be Jada Pinkett Smith as Nell be and  acting colleague Yaya up to Martina in  front of the camera How I Met Your  Mother star Neil Patrick Harris will  also be part of the cast the u.s. cinema  release of metrics for is on May 21st  2021 this search for a new director for  dr. strange too has finally come to an  end after the Marvel movie hadn't had a  director for almost a month a recent  report from Variety now suggests that  Marvel Studios is currently in  negotiations with Sammy Raimi many  people might know him as the director of  the 2002 spider-man movie with Tobey  Maguire and the leading role an official  statement that he will inherit the  previous director Scott Erickson is  still pending the only thing that is  certain so far is that leading actor  Benedict Cumberbatch will return as  Doctor Strange together with him  benedict wong and xu @ l @ u 4 will also  be back in front of the camera but  before Doctor Strange 2 will be released  on may 7th in 2021 the Marvel films  Black Widow the Eternals  and zhongshi and the legend of the ten  rings will be released in the cinemas  horror fans watch out 14 years after the  film adaptation of Silent Hill director  Christophe Gong has now announced  another adaptation but that's not all as  he also told Allison II that a film  version of fatal frame is planned but  first things first  Silent Hill is about a small town where  author Harry Mason wants to spend a  holiday with his daughter on the way  there however they are involved in a car  accident and when Mason regains  consciousness his daughter has  disappeared on his search for her he  gets to face a series of monsters and  creatures in the now not so sleepy small  town at least that's the story of the  first part of the video game but in 2006  film adaptation the plot is slightly  different there Rose  and her daughter Sharon make their way  to Silent Hill to get to the bottom of  Sharon's strange nightmares whether the  new movie is more oriented towards the  video game series or its predecessor is  not clear at the moment in fatal frame  however it's about a missing journalist  named ma fuyi he seems to have  disappeared in a huge villa while  searching for material for a new story  and his sister Miku is searching for him  there as you can imagine this story also  doesn't really work out in favor of the  protagonists regarding this project  director Gao only revealed that it will  take place in Japan and that he doesn't  want to miss the typical Japanese  haunted house setting unfortunately  there is no further information about  both projects at the moment  [Music]
 

